    "rendered": "المصحف تحميل سورة البقرة مكتوبة كاملة بخط كبير"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<div class=\"wp-block-image is-style-rounded\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"447\" height=\"559\" src=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/quarn-12.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5236\" style=\"width:295px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/quarn-12.png 447w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/quarn-12-240x300.png 240w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 447px) 100vw, 447px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">للتحميل سورة البقرة مكتوبة كاملة من المصحف pdf من موقع مكتبة المعرفة العلمية.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>معلومات عن الملف :</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">نوع الملف : بي دي اف&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">حجم الملف : 2 ميغابايت.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">عدد الصفحات : 111 .</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong> تحميل سورة البقرة مكتوبة كاملة بخط كبير</strong></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1L_MQFr27aw2ho1VVo6Rxk_eeggMN2yJH/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" src=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5735\" style=\"width:134px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1-1.png 256w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1-1-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 256px) 100vw, 256px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> </p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
